Arara Code: preserva o caminho curto de uma unidade subst no postinstall do Windows, evitando o limite de 260 caracteres do MSBuild.

Why a patch: a instalacao de dependencias antecede as extensoes. Somente o Windows deixa de expandir o caminho via realpath; Linux e macOS preservam o comportamento original.
Touches: build/npm/installStateHash.ts

--- a/build/npm/installStateHash.ts
+++ b/build/npm/installStateHash.ts
@@ -8,7 +8,9 @@
 import path from 'path';
 import { dirs } from './dirs.ts';
 
-export const root = fs.realpathSync.native(path.dirname(path.dirname(import.meta.dirname)));
+export const root = process.platform === 'win32'
+	? path.dirname(path.dirname(import.meta.dirname))
+	: fs.realpathSync.native(path.dirname(path.dirname(import.meta.dirname)));
 export const stateFile = path.join(root, 'node_modules', '.postinstall-state');
 export const stateContentsFile = path.join(root, 'node_modules', '.postinstall-state-contents');
 export const forceInstallMessage = 'Run \x1b[36mnode build/npm/fast-install.ts --force\x1b[0m to force a full install.';
